    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Overlord is a rogue-lite deck-builder.\u00a0 Travel the galaxy, hone your deck, find strange and powerful artifacts, and defeat the rebels!\u00a0 Balance your deck carefully to maintain the favor you have with the different factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.poster.avif?t=1753307458\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.webm?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.mp4?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play as the titular Galactic Overlord, using your cards to call in favors from the various loyal factions.\u00a0 Each faction will usually offer only one favor per turn, so when building your deck, you must make sure to balance cards of each faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.poster.avif?t=1753307458\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.webm?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.mp4?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique resource mechanic forces you to weigh the benefits of faction synergy and the ability to play multiple cards.\u00a0 Master it, and you can bring peace back to the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique runs with randomly generated opponents, artifacts, and cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full story mode and ending, as well as an endless mode for high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully moddable.\u00a0 Create your own cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming sci-fi setting with colorful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Overlord is a rogue-lite deck-builder.\u00a0 Travel the galaxy, hone your deck, find strange and powerful artifacts, and defeat the rebels!\u00a0 Balance your deck carefully to maintain the favor you have with the different factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.poster.avif?t=1753307458\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.webm?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/d3960fb62a3ef472394c11537203da2a.mp4?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play as the titular Galactic Overlord, using your cards to call in favors from the various loyal factions.\u00a0 Each faction will usually offer only one favor per turn, so when building your deck, you must make sure to balance cards of each faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.poster.avif?t=1753307458\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.webm?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810580/extras/b9650b6766b2968fd6c0148548284a9f.mp4?t=1753307458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique resource mechanic forces you to weigh the benefits of faction synergy and the ability to play multiple cards.\u00a0 Master it, and you can bring peace back to the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique runs with randomly generated opponents, artifacts, and cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full story mode and ending, as well as an endless mode for high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully moddable.\u00a0 Create your own cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming sci-fi setting with colorful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
